            "review_title": "Review at Ciao! Vo Dep",
            "review_text": "Christopher V\n2 contributions\n0\nIs it really worth the money?\nAug 2017 • Couples\nVisited last night, and do have to say the environment was good, the place was tidy, and had a very good service that was nice, and even assisted when I didn't have cash but only only card (my mistake) - they don't accept card, only cash.\n\nIn my opinion, the food was quite a common tasting steak, had Steak and Mushroom Sauce, got a small one, which was the bad part, because I didn't know what small was, turns out it was very small compared to TGI, or SteakHouse, there was also a VERY small amount of mashed potatoes, and a tiny amount of Mushroom Sauce.\n\nI also noticed when I got home my bill said 212,000₫ and I paid with 500,000₫ But only got back 220,000 change? (Not sure if that is right, either way that was also my fault as I didn't count it on the spot --\")\n\nFor my photos it looks big, but in reality the expectation is completely wrong.\nRead more\nWritten August 2, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
